# Wave W17-P (Route 117): day sand — flower-road pale sand: a warm bright sand running the fields’ length, petal-pale in its flecks where the beds lean over the road (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Wildflower to Lilac). Split from Route 116’s cool echo sand by warmth: this is the sunny side of the hill.
